 used the [contenthash] token so that the bundle file name changes when its content changes, which will bust the browser…"],"features":["lib: The standard typing to be included in the type checking process. In our case, we have chosen to use the types for the browser’s DOM and the latest version of ECMAScript.","allowJs: Whether to allow JavaScript files to be compiled.","allowSyntheticDefaultImports: This allows default imports from modules with no default export in the type checking process.","skipLibCheck: Whether to skip type checking of all the type declaration files (.d.ts).","esModuleInterop: This enables compatibility with Babel."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/subodh-kumar1/react-app/blob/development-v5/README.md","fingerprint":"c2380816cf2278ff99bae197091940a4554a127dc83aa26f36d3069258c78c84","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T20:11:27.048Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:11:27.048Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Here are the critical bits in this webpack.dev.config.ts file:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/subodh-kumar1/react-app/blob/development-v5/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"c2380816cf2278ff99bae197091940a4554a127dc83aa26f36d3069258c78c84","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/subodh-kumar1/react-app/blob/development-v5/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T20:11:27.049Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2023-01-01T11:30:37Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/subodh-kumar1/react-app/blob/development-v5/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T20:11:27.049Z","hash":"c2380816cf2278ff99bae197091940a4554a127dc83aa26f36d3069258c78c84","originalBytes":4779,"storedBytes":4779,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["webpack","babel","files","field","tells","code","development","project","react","type","typescript","which","allow","checking","code.","javascript","modules","process.","whether","allows","file","name","app","browser","build","bundle.","core","during","eslint","files.","folder","get"